Recommends: glusterfs-server
Description: Gluster block storage utility
 gluster-block is a CLI utility, which aims at making gluster backed block
 storage creation and maintenance as simple as possible. It exports files on
 a Gluster volume as iSCSI LUNs through tcmu-runner and LIO.
